	// CustomsContentType Specifies the content of the package or envelope.
	//  * MERCHANDISE
	//  * GIFT
	//  * DOCUMENT
	//  * COMMERCIAL_SAMPLE
	//  * RETURNED_GOODS
	//  * OTHER
	//  * HUMANITARIAN_DONATIONS
